<title>UK: Hong Kong stocks edge lower in London.</title>
<headline>Hong Kong stocks edge lower in London.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong stocks passed a quiet Friday in London with no fresh news to provide direction ahead of the weekend, dealers said.</p>
<p>Prices edged lower in line with moves in London and New York, they added.</p>
<p>At 1420 GMT the Hang seng London reference index was down 14.57 points at 12,631.19. The Hang Seng index lost 81.07 points to 12,643.28 earlier.</p>
